  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Teri Mini Crossbody is the smallest bag in our beloved Teri Collection. Crafted of refined pebble leather, this bag is designed for everyday wear. It has a detachable long strap so you can switch up how you wear it—from shoulder bag to crossbody. This crossbody bag is perfect for carrying daily essentials like keys, cards and your favorite items inside its snap pocket.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Refined pebble leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside snap pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable long strap with 22.5&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
